Z||000000||BPacholka||09-26-2001||07:23 AM||||Are there any active Michigan clubs around? I have tried to contact the Michigan Fiero CLub on several occasions and have not received any replies.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Tigger||09-26-2001||08:40 AM||||The MFC is active, but I'm not sure how active the webpage and webmaster is.<P>Print the sign up form on the site and mail in the form & fee and they'll sign you up.  You'll soon recieve a membership packet and the monthly newsletters.<P>The MFC is having their annual Fall Color Cruise Oct. 5,6,7, & 8.  Email Barb Hack, I believe she is the director of club activities at barbFiero@webtv.net and she will have all the information on the cruise.  Make sure to let her know you've been trying to contact the club but have got no response.<P>BTW, Welcome to the forum!<P>Brent<p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 09-26-2001).]||||reg||1
